: 'OMC', 'date': '2021-11-16 10:09:00', 'title': 'FLEISHMANHILLARD NAMED A TOP 10 BEST COMPANY FOR WOMEN BY SERAMOUNT FOR 2021', 'text': "ST. LOUIS, NOV. 16, 2021 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- FLEISHMANHILLARD WAS NAMED TO SERAMOUNT'S 2021 TOP 75 COMPANIES FOR EXECUTIVE WOMEN LIST TODAY FOR THE 12TH CONSECUTIVE YEAR, ALSO BEING RECOGNIZED IN THE TOP 10 FOR THE SIXTH YEAR. SERAMOUNT CONTINUES TO EXPLORE WAYS ORGANIZATIONS CAN MOVE MORE WOMEN EXECUTIVES INTO TOP POSITIONS, WHILE HIGHLIGHTING THE SUCCESSES AT THESE TRAILBLAZING COMPANIES."}{'symbol': 'ORCL', 'date': '2021-11-16 13:35:00', 'title': 'ORACLE ACONEX ACHIEVES BRITISH STANDARDS INSTITUTION CERTIFICATION FOR BUILDING INFORMATION MODELING SOFTWARE', 'text': 'AUSTIN, TEXAS, NOV. 16, 2021 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- ORACLE ACONEX\xa0IS THE FIRST PROJECT MANAGEMENT SOLUTION TO ACHIEVE BRITISH STANDARDS INSTITUTION (BSI) KITEMARK CERTIFICATION\xa0OF THE ISO STANDARD AND DIN SPECIFICATION FOR BUILDING INFORMATION MODELING (BIM)\xa0SOFTWARE. THIS GLOBAL CERTIFICATION GIVES ENGINEERING AND CONSTRUCTION ORGANIZATIONS THE CONFIDENCE THAT ORACLE ACONEX\xa0COMPLIES WITH THE LATEST BIM STANDARDS, WHICH CAN SPEED SOFTWARE PROCUREMENT, MITIGATE PROJECT RISK, AND SAVE COMPANIES TIME AND MONEY.'}{'symbol': 'PANW', 'date': '2021-11-16 08:20:00', 'title': "PALO ALTO NETWORKS DELIVERS WHAT'S NEXT IN SECURITY AT IGNITE '21", 'text': 'SANTA CLARA, CALIF., NOV. 16, 2021 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- PALO ALTO NETWORKS (NASDAQ: PANW)\xa0TODAY SHOWCASED INDUSTRY-FIRST SECURITY INNOVATIONS TO HELP ORGANIZATIONS PROTECT A RAPIDLY EXPANDING ATTACK SURFACE.'}{'symbol': 'PANW', 'date': '2021-11-16 08:16:00', 'title': 'PALO ALTO NETWORKS LAUNCHES CORTEX EXTENDED MANAGED DETECTION AND RESPONSE (XMDR) PARTNER SPECIALIZATION', 'text': 'SANTA CLARA, CALIF., NOV. 16, 2021 /PRNEWSWIRE/ --\xa0PALO ALTO NETWORKS (NASDAQ: PANW), TODAY ANNOUNCED ITS CORTEX® EXTENDED MANAGED DETECTION\xa0AND RESPONSE (XMDR) PARTNER SPECIALIZATION TO HELP CUSTOMERS DETECT, INVESTIGATE AND RESPOND TO CYBERTH